name: sim.resetCollision
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.resetCollision(int collisionObjectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. collisionObjectHandle: handle of the collision object or sim.handle_all or sim.handle_all_except_explicit. (sim.handle_all will reset all registered collision objects, while sim.handle_all_except_explicit will only reset those that are not marked as "explicit handling")
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
